{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1766470050439,"prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and senior-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: SENIOR - Job Title: Senior Backend Engineer - Key Responsibilities (3 identified): Lead backend service design Ensure high availability Mentor junior engineers CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: CASE_STUDY RECRUITER'S CUSTOM REQUIREMENTS: Include behavior and system design questions VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: case_study - Difficulty: medium - Create realistic scenarios with 3-4 interconnected challenges. Include ambiguous elements requiring judgment. - Duration: 120 minutes - Target Length: 800 words - Questions: 7 ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Acme Tech is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Acme Tech recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Acme Tech is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Senior Backend Engineer at Acme Tech, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION (800 words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Senior Backend Engineer in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Senior Backend Engineer at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Senior Backend Engineer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 120 \"case_study_type\": \"case_study\", \"difficulty_level\": \"medium\", \"num_questions\": 7, \"content_length\": \"800\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Senior Backend Engineer\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"senior\", \"document_context_used\": false } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE LANGUAGE OR PLACEHOLDER TEXT ✓ REFERENCE SPECIFIC METRICS/NUMBERS FROM THE DESCRIPTION ✓ BUILD ON SCENARIO CONTEXT - NOT GENERIC ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE 2-4 DETAILED SENTENCES ✓ NO DIFFICULTY LEVEL INDICATORS IN QUESTION TEXT ✓ QUESTIONS SHOULD BUILD IN DEPTH/COMPLEXITY ✓ VARIANT FOCUS IS EMBEDDED IN QUESTION DESIGN ===== VALIDATION CHECKLIST ===== ✓ Description starts with company name and what they do ✓ Description builds: Company → Scale → Expertise → Challenge ✓ NO role assignment in description section ✓ Instructions starts with \"As the Senior Backend Engineer...\" ✓ All content is specific to Senior Backend Engineer role ✓ Industry terminology used: tech ✓ Appropriate seniority level: senior ✓ 7 specific questions included ✓ All questions reference specific scenario details ✓ Tables have realistic, industry-appropriate data ✓ Variant 1 focus embedded in scenario ✓ Industry terminology used correctly ✓ Appropriate for senior level ✓ Valid JSON only ✓ Both sections are cohesive and interconnected ✓ Both English and Arabic sections complete ✓ Metrics are realistic for tech industry ===== MANDATORY BILINGUAL REQUIREMENTS ===== - BOTH 'en' AND 'ar' SECTIONS MUST BE PRESENT AND FULLY POPULATED. - The 'ar' section MUST be a proper Arabic translation of the corresponding 'en' fields (questions arrays and tables MUST match lengths and structure). - DO NOT RETURN PARTIAL ARABIC TRANSLATIONS. If Arabic cannot be provided, include a top-level 'error' field with value 'MISSING_AR'. - RETURN ONLY VALID JSON. NO MARKDOWN, NO EXPLANATIONS."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1766470126559,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] NXT LABS, a leading technology firm based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, is looking for a Senior Database Engineer specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. This full-time role involves managing and optimizing database systems, including MySQL and PostgreSQL, implementing robust disaster recovery solutions, and managing cloud databases on AWS and Azure. The ideal candidate will have a minimum of 5 years of experience in database administration with a strong focus on performance tuning. NXT LABS offers a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
