ate clarity, depth, relevance, structure - For video responses: Return score as null and feedback \"Pending manual review - recruiter must watch and score the video submission\". Video responses CANNOT be auto-scored. - For Excel tasks: Evaluate formula correctness, data analysis approach - For situational judgment: Evaluate decision-making, reasoning, practical application - Score each on 0-100 scale with detailed feedback (except video which should be null) CRITICAL: ALL TEXT FEEDBACK MUST BE IN English. JOB/ASSESSMENT: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions CANDIDATE: Muhammad Muneeb CASE STUDY QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS: Q1: What strategies would you implement to reduce the current latency issues in the cloud databases, and how would you measure success? A: I dont know NOTE: Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly. RETURN ONLY VALID JSON (no markdown, no explanations): { \"overall_score\": <0-100>, \"rating\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"ai_detected\": false, \"recruiter_feedback\": \"<Comprehensive feedback in English>\", \"question_scores\": [{ \"question_number\": 1, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" }], \"skill_scores\": [{ \"skill_name\": \"PostgreSQL\", \"category\": \"Database\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"AWS\", \"category\": \"Cloud\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Collaboration\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Data Security\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"MySQL\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Disaster Recovery\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Azure\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Performance Tuning\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true }], \"psychometric_scores\": [], \"custom_question_scores\": [{ \"question_id\": 53, \"question_type\": \"video_response\", \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\", \"code_quality\": null }], \"final_recommendation\": \"<Hire|Interview|Review|Reject>\" }"}
