{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1766735236486,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional video interview questions for job candidates. JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions Description: NXT LABS, a leading technology firm based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, is looking for a Senior Database Engineer specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. This full-time role involves managing and optimizing database systems, including MySQL and PostgreSQL, implementing robust disaster recovery solutions, and managing cloud databases on AWS and Azure. The ideal candidate will have a minimum of 5 years of experience in database administration with a strong focus on performance tuning. NXT LABS offers a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth. Key Responsibilities: 1. Configure, manage, and optimize MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. 2. Design and implement disaster recovery strategies. 3. Oversee cloud database management on AWS and Azure. 4. Conduct database performance tuning and optimization. 5. Collaborate with the development team to support database requirements. 6. Ensure data security and integrity across all database platforms. 7. Monitor database performance and troubleshoot issues promptly. ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company_overview\": { \"name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"industry\": \"Technology\", \"founded_year\": null }, \"company_scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": \"Rawalpindi, Pakistan\", \"global_presence\": null }, \"expertise_core_business\": { \"specialties\": \"High availability, disaster recovery, cloud solutions\", \"main_products_services\": \"Database management and optimization, cloud database management on AWS and Azure\" }, \"company_culture_mission_values\": { \"mission_statement\": null, \"core_values\": null, \"company_culture\": \"Dynamic work environment with opportunities for professional growth\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"Leading technology firm\" } }, \"ar\": { \"company_overview\": { \"name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"industry\": \"التكنولوجيا\", \"founded_year\": null }, \"company_scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": \"روالبندي، باكستان\", \"global_presence\": null }, \"expertise_core_business\": { \"specialties\": \"التوافر العالي، استعادة البيانات بعد الكوارث، حلول السحابة\", \"main_products_services\": \"إدارة وتحسين قواعد البيانات، إدارة قواعد البيانات السحابية على AWS وAzure\" }, \"company_culture_mission_values\": { \"mission_statement\": null, \"core_values\": null, \"company_culture\": \"بيئة عمل ديناميكية مع فرص للنمو المهني\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"شركة رائدة في مجال التكنولوجيا\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === TASK: Generate 1 video response questions to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: EASY - Questions should be suitable for 2-5 minute video responses - Include behavioral (STAR method) and situational questions - Provide evaluation criteria for reviewers Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"questions\": [ { \"question_en\": \"English question text\", \"question_ar\": \"نص السؤال بالعربية\", \"preparation_time_seconds\": 30, \"max_response_time_seconds\": 180, \"evaluation_criteria_en\": [\"Criteria 1\", \"Criteria 2\", \"Criteria 3\"], \"evaluation_criteria_ar\": [\"المعيار 1\", \"المعيار 2\", \"المعيار 3\"], \"tips_for_candidate_en\": \"Brief tip for the candidate\", \"tips_for_candidate_ar\": \"نصيحة مختصرة للمرشح\", \"difficulty\": \"easy\", \"category\": \"behavioral/communication/leadership\" } ] }"}
