{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1766748779958,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating concise, relevant case study titles. Based on this case study focus area and content, generate 2 titles: 1. An English title (max 80 characters, compelling and specific) 2. An Arabic title (max 80 characters, compelling and specific) CONTEXT: Job: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions Case Study Type: analytical Description Summary: Company NXT LABS is a technology company that specializes in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. Based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, NXT LABS is recognized as a leading technology firm. However, NXT LABS recently faced challenges in optimizing database performance and managing infr... Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"title_en\": \"English title here\", \"title_ar\": \"العنوان بالعربية هنا\" }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1766748781047,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional assessment questions for job candidates. JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions Description: NXT LABS, a leading technology firm based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, is looking for a Senior Database Engineer specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. This full-time role involves managing and optimizing database systems, including MySQL and PostgreSQL, implementing robust disaster recovery solutions, and managing cloud databases on AWS and Azure. The ideal candidate will have a minimum of 5 years of experience in database administration with a strong focus on performance tuning. NXT LABS offers a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth. Key Responsibilities: 1. Configure, manage, and optimize MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. 2. Design and implement disaster recovery strategies. 3. Oversee cloud database management on AWS and Azure. 4. Conduct database performance tuning and optimization. 5. Collaborate with the development team to support database requirements. 6. Ensure data security and integrity across all database platforms. 7. Monitor database performance and troubleshoot issues promptly. ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company_name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"industry\": \"Technology\", \"founded_year\": null, \"scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": \"Based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan\", \"countries\": null }, \"expertise\": \"High availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions\", \"main_products_services\": \"Database management and optimization, disaster recovery solutions, cloud database management on AWS and Azure\", \"mission_statement\": null, \"core_values\": null, \"company_culture\": \"Dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth\", \"market_position\": \"Leading technology firm\" }, \"ar\": { \"company_name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"industry\": \"التكنولوجيا\", \"founded_year\": null, \"scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": \"مقرها في روالبندي، باكستان\", \"countries\": null }, \"expertise\": \"التوافر العالي، استعادة البيانات بعد الكوارث، وحلول السحابة\", \"main_products_services\": \"إدارة وتحسين قواعد البيانات، حلول استعادة البيانات بعد الكوارث، إدارة قواعد البيانات السحابية على AWS و Azure\", \"mission_statement\": null, \"core_values\": null, \"company_culture\": \"بيئة عمل ديناميكية مع فرص وفيرة للنمو المهني\", \"market_position\": \"شركة رائدة في مجال التكنولوجيا\" } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === TASK: Generate 5 multiple choice questions to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: MEDIUM - Each question must have exactly 4 options (A, B, C, D) - Only ONE correct answer per question - Questions should be relevant to the job role - Include mix of knowledge, scenario, and application questions - Provide clear explanation for the correct answer Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"questions\": [ { \"question_en\": \"English question text\", \"question_ar\": \"نص السؤال بالعربية\", \"options\": [ { \"id\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"Option A in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار أ بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": false }, { \"id\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"Option B in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار ب بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": true }, { \"id\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"Option C in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار ج بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": false }, { \"id\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"Option D in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار د بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": false } ], \"explanation_en\": \"Explanation why B is correct\", \"explanation_ar\": \"شرح لماذا ب هو الصحيح\", \"difficulty\": \"medium\", \"category\": \"technical/behavioral/analytical\" } ] }"}
