l review - recruiter must watch and score the video submission\". Video responses CANNOT be auto-scored. - For Excel tasks: Evaluate formula correctness, data analysis approach - For situational judgment: Evaluate decision-making, reasoning, practical application - Score each on 0-100 scale with detailed feedback (except video which should be null) CRITICAL: ALL TEXT FEEDBACK MUST BE IN English. JOB/ASSESSMENT: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions CANDIDATE: Muhammad Muneeb CASE STUDY QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS: Q1: Identify specific database configurations that could be optimized to reduce current latency issues. What steps would you take to implement these optimizations? [⚠️ AI Detection: 73.2%] A: To optimize database configurations and reduce latency issues, focus on these areas: Indexing: Add or optimize indexes for frequently queried columns to speed up data retrieval. Query Optimization: Refactor slow queries, ensuring they are efficient and avoid unnecessary joins or subqueries. Connection Pooling: Use connection pooling to reduce the overhead of creating and destroying database connections. Caching: Implement query caching for frequently accessed data to reduce database load. Data Partitioning/Sharding: Split large datasets into smaller, more manageable parts to improve read/write performance. Database Configuration Tuning: Adjust parameters like buffer_size, cache_size, and work_mem based on the database workload. Steps to implement: Review and analyze current database performance (e.g., using slow query logs or monitoring tools). Apply index optimizations based on query analysis. Refactor and optimize slow queries. Implement connection pooling and caching mechanisms. Tune database parameters according to performance benchmarks. Monitor results to ensure improvements. Q2: How would you design a disaster recovery strategy to minimize downtime during a system outage? Include specific technologies you would use. A: NO ANSWER Q3: Consider the current deployment frequency and incident response time. What process improvements could be implemented to enhance these metrics? A: NO ANSWER Q4: Discuss how you would collaborate with the development team to ensure database requirements are met during sprints. What challenges might you face? A: NO ANSWER Q5: What tools or frameworks would you use to monitor database performance and proactively address potential issues? A: NO ANSWER Q6: Given the existing cloud infrastructure, how would you approach scaling the databases on AWS and Azure to handle increased throughput? A: NO ANSWER Q7: Evaluate the current test coverage percentage for database changes. How would you improve this to ensure code quality and system reliability? A: NO ANSWER NOTE: Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly. RETURN ONLY VALID JSON (no markdown, no explanations): { \"overall_score\": <0-100>, \"rating\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"ai_detected\": true, \"recruiter_feedback\": \"<Comprehensive feedback in English>\", \"question_scores\": [{ \"question_number\": 1, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English - mention AI detection>\" },{ \"question_number\": 2, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" },{ \"question_number\": 3, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" },{ \"question_number\": 4, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" },{ \"question_number\": 5, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" },{ \"question_number\": 6, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" },{ \"question_number\": 7, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" }], \"skill_scores\": [{ \"skill_name\": \"PostgreSQL\", \"category\": \"Database\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"AWS\", \"category\": \"Cloud\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Collaboration\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Data Security\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"MySQL\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Disaster Recovery\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Azure\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Performance Tuning\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true }], \"psychometric_scores\": [], \"custom_question_scores\": [{ \"question_id\": 76, \"question_type\": \"open_ended\", \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\", \"code_quality\": null },{ \"question_id\": 77, \"question_type\": \"open_ended\", \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\", \"code_quality\": null }], \"final_recommendation\": \"<Hire|Interview|Review|Reject>\" }"}
