aining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION ( words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key