ices\": \"Rawalpindi, Pakistan\", \"countries\": null }, \"expertise\": \"High availability, disaster recovery, cloud solutions\", \"main_products_services\": \"Database systems management, disaster recovery solutions, cloud database management\", \"mission_statement\": null, \"core_values\": null, \"company_culture\": \"Dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"Leading technology firm\" }, \"ar\": { \"company_name\": \"مختبرات ني إكس تي\", \"business_type\": \"شركة تكنولوجيا\", \"founded_year\": null, \"scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": \"روالبندي، باكستان\", \"countries\": null }, \"expertise\": \"التوافر العالي، استعادة البيانات بعد الكوارث، حلول السحابة\", \"main_products_services\": \"إدارة أنظمة قواعد البيانات، حلول استعادة البيانات، إدارة قواعد البيانات السحابية\", \"mission_statement\": null, \"core_values\": null, \"company_culture\": \"بيئة عمل ديناميكية مع فرص وفيرة للنمو المهني\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"شركة تكنولوجيا رائدة\" } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Company XYZ is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION ( words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 60 \"case_study_type\": \"analytical\", \"difficulty_level\": \"1\", \"num_questions\": 300-500, \"content_length\": \"\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"senior\", \"document_context_used\": true } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE LANGUAGE OR PLACEHOLDER TEXT ✓ REFERENCE SPECIFIC METRICS/NUMBERS FROM THE DESCRIPTION ✓ BUILD ON SCENARIO CONTEXT - NOT GENERIC ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE 2-4 DETAILED SENTENCES ✓ NO DIFFICULTY LEVEL INDICATORS IN QUESTION TEXT ✓ QUESTIONS SHOULD BUILD IN DEPTH/COMPLEXITY ✓ VARIANT FOCUS IS EMBEDDED IN QUESTION DESIGN ===== VALIDATION CHECKLIST ===== ✓ Description starts with company name and what they do ✓ Description builds: Company → Scale → Expertise → Challenge ✓ NO role assignment in description section ✓ Instructions starts with \"As the Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions...\" ✓ All content is specific to Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions role ✓ Industry terminology used: tech ✓ Appropriate seniority level: senior ✓ 300-500 specific questions included ✓ All questions reference specific scenario details ✓ Tables have realistic, industry-appropriate data ✓ Variant 1 focus embedded in scenario ✓ Industry terminology used correctly ✓ Appropriate for senior level ✓ Valid JSON only ✓ Both sections are cohesive and interconnected ✓ Both English and Arabic sections complete ✓ Metrics are realistic for tech industry ===== MANDATORY BILINGUAL REQUIREMENTS ===== - BOTH 'en' AND 'ar' SECTIONS MUST BE PRESENT AND FULLY POPULATED. - The 'ar' section MUST be a proper Arabic translation of the corresponding 'en' fields (questions arrays and tables MUST match lengths and structure). - DO NOT RETURN PARTIAL ARABIC TRANSLATIONS. If Arabic cannot be provided, include a top-level 'error' field wit"}
