ability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 60 \"case_study_type\": \"analytical\", \"difficulty_level\": \"1\", \"num_questions\": 300-500, \"content_length\": \"\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"senior\", \"document_context_used\": true } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE LANGUAGE OR PLACEHOLDER TEXT ✓ REFERENCE SPECIFIC METRICS/NUMBERS FROM THE DESCRIPTION ✓ BUILD ON SCENARIO CONTEXT - NOT GENERIC ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE 2-4 DETAILED SENTENCES ✓ NO DIFFICULTY LEVEL INDICATORS IN QUESTION TEXT ✓ QUESTIONS SHOULD BUILD IN DEPTH/COMPLEXITY ✓ VARIANT FOCUS IS EMBEDDED IN QUESTION DESIGN ===== VALIDATION CHECKLIST ===== ✓ Description starts with company name and what they do ✓ Description builds: Company → Scale → Expertise → Challenge ✓ NO role assignment in description section ✓ Instructions starts with \"As the Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions...\" ✓ All content is specific to Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions role ✓ Industry terminology 