{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767072667141,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767072669309,"prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and mid-level-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: MID-LEVEL - Job Title: Full Stack Developer - Key Responsibilities (8 identified): • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: ANALYTICAL VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: analytical - Difficulty: 1 - undefined - Duration: 60 minutes - Target Length: words - Questions: 300-500 ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"\", \"WhatTheyDo\": \"\", \"FoundedYear\": \"\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"\", \"Offices\": \"\", \"Countries\": \"\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": \"\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"\" }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"\", \"CoreValues\": \"\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"\", \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"\" } }, \"ar\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"\", \"WhatTheyDo\": \"\", \"FoundedYear\": \"\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"\", \"Offices\": \"\", \"Countries\": \"\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": \"\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"\" }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"\", \"CoreValues\": \"\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"\", \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Company XYZ is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Full Stack Developer at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION ( words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Full Stack Developer in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Full Stack Developer at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Full Stack Developer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 60 \"case_study_type\": \"analytical\", \"difficulty_level\": \"1\", \"num_questions\": 300-500, \"content_length\": \"\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Full Stack Developer\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"mid-level\", \"document_context_used\": true } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE LANGUAGE OR PLACEHOLDER TEXT ✓ REFERENCE SPECIFIC METRICS/NUMBERS FROM THE DESCRIPTION ✓ BUILD ON SCENARIO CONTEXT - NOT GENERIC ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE 2-4 DETAILED SENTENCES ✓ NO DIFFICULTY LEVEL INDICATORS IN QUESTION TEXT ✓ QUESTIONS SHOULD BUILD IN DEPTH/COMPLEXITY ✓ VARIANT FOCUS IS EMBEDDED IN QUESTION DESIGN ===== VALIDATION CHECKLIST ===== ✓ Description starts with company name and what they do ✓ Description builds: Company → Scale → Expertise → Challenge ✓ NO role assignment in description section ✓ Instructions starts with \"As the Full Stack Developer...\" ✓ All content is specific to Full Stack Developer role ✓ Industry terminology used: tech ✓ Appropriate seniority level: mid-level ✓ 300-500 specific questions included ✓ All questions reference specific scenario details ✓ Tables have realistic, industry-appropriate data ✓ Variant 1 focus embedded in scenario ✓ Industry terminology used correctly ✓ Appropriate for mid-level level ✓ Valid JSON only ✓ Both sections are cohesive and interconnected ✓ Both English and Arabic sections complete ✓ Metrics are realistic for tech industry ===== MANDATORY BILINGUAL REQUIREMENTS ===== - BOTH 'en' AND 'ar' SECTIONS MUST BE PRESENT AND FULLY POPULATED. - The 'ar' section MUST be a proper Arabic translation of the corresponding 'en' fields (questions arrays and tables MUST match lengths and structure). - DO NOT RETURN PARTIAL ARABIC TRANSLATIONS. If Arabic cannot be provided, include a top-level 'error' field with value 'MISSING_AR'. - RETURN ONLY VALID JSON. NO MARKDOWN, NO EXPLANATIONS."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767072696364,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating concise, relevant case study titles. Based on this case study focus area and content, generate 2 titles: 1. An English title (max 80 characters, compelling and specific) 2. An Arabic title (max 80 characters, compelling and specific) CONTEXT: Job: Full Stack Developer Case Study Type: analytical Description Summary: Company XYZ is a tech company that specializes in developing cutting-edge web applications and innovative digital solutions. Founded in 2010, the company has quickly grown to establish a significant presence in the industry. With offices in five countries and a workforce of over 500 employees, the c... Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"title_en\": \"English title here\", \"title_ar\": \"العنوان بالعربية هنا\" }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767072697529,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional assessment questions for job candidates. JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Full Stack Developer Description: We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Key Responsibilities: • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"\", \"WhatTheyDo\": \"\", \"FoundedYear\": \"\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"\", \"Offices\": \"\", \"Countries\": \"\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": \"\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"\" }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"\", \"CoreValues\": \"\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"\", \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"\" } }, \"ar\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"\", \"WhatTheyDo\": \"\", \"FoundedYear\": \"\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"\", \"Offices\": \"\", \"Countries\": \"\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": \"\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"\" }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"\", \"CoreValues\": \"\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"\", \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === TASK: Generate 2 open-ended questions to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: EASY - Questions should require detailed, thoughtful responses - Include scenario-based and reflective questions - Provide keywords/criteria for AI scoring - Include sample strong responses Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"questions\": [ { \"question_en\": \"English question text\", \"question_ar\": \"نص السؤال بالعربية\", \"expected_keywords\": [\"keyword1\", \"keyword2\", \"keyword3\"], \"scoring_criteria_en\": \"What to look for in a good answer\", \"scoring_criteria_ar\": \"ما يجب البحث عنه في الإجابة الجيدة\", \"sample_strong_response_en\": \"Example of a strong answer\", \"sample_strong_response_ar\": \"مثال على إجابة قوية\", \"min_word_count\": 100, \"max_word_count\": 500, \"difficulty\": \"easy\", \"category\": \"behavioral/analytical/creative\" } ] }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767072707046,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional coding challenges for software developer candidates. JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Full Stack Developer Description: We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Key Responsibilities: • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"\", \"WhatTheyDo\": \"\", \"FoundedYear\": \"\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"\", \"Offices\": \"\", \"Countries\": \"\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": \"\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"\" }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"\", \"CoreValues\": \"\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"\", \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"\" } }, \"ar\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"\", \"WhatTheyDo\": \"\", \"FoundedYear\": \"\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"\", \"Offices\": \"\", \"Countries\": \"\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": \"\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"\" }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"\", \"CoreValues\": \"\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"\", \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === TASK: Generate 1 coding challenges to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: EASY - Include clear problem statement - Provide input/output examples - Include test cases for validation - Support multiple programming languages (Python, JavaScript, Java) Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"challenges\": [ { \"title_en\": \"Challenge Title\", \"title_ar\": \"عنوان التحدي\", \"problem_statement_en\": \"Detailed problem description\", \"problem_statement_ar\": \"وصف المشكلة بالتفصيل\", \"input_format_en\": \"Description of input format\", \"input_format_ar\": \"وصف تنسيق الإدخال\", \"output_format_en\": \"Description of expected output\", \"output_format_ar\": \"وصف المخرجات المتوقعة\", \"constraints_en\": [\"Time constraint\", \"Memory constraint\"], \"constraints_ar\": [\"قيد الوقت\", \"قيد الذاكرة\"], \"examples\": [ { \"input\": \"sample input\", \"output\": \"expected output\", \"explanation_en\": \"Why this output\", \"explanation_ar\": \"لماذا هذا الإخراج\" } ], \"test_cases\": [ { \"input\": \"test1\", \"expected_output\": \"output1\", \"is_hidden\": false }, { \"input\": \"test2\", \"expected_output\": \"output2\", \"is_hidden\": true } ], \"starter_code\": { \"python\": \"def solution(input):\\n # Your code here\\n pass\", \"javascript\": \"function solution(input) {\\n // Your code here\\n}\", \"java\": \"public class Solution {\\n public static String solution(String input) {\\n // Your code here\\n return \\\"\\\";\\n }\\n}\" }, \"difficulty\": \"easy\", \"tags\": [\"arrays\", \"strings\", \"algorithms\"] } ] }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767072775661,"prompt":"You are a STRICT and CRITICAL Technical Recruiter evaluating case study submissions. CRITICAL EVALUATION STANDARDS: - ONE-LINERS: Maximum 30/100 - VAGUE ANSWERS: Maximum 50/100 - MISSING PRIORITIZATION: -20 minimum - NO METRICS: -15 points - NO IMPLEMENTATION: -15 points SCORING RUBRIC: - 90-100: Exceptional - Detailed, strategic, prioritized, with metrics and implementation - 75-89: Good - Comprehensive with most elements - 60-74: Acceptable - Main points but lacks depth - 40-59: Poor - Superficial, missing elements - 0-39: Unacceptable - One-liners or irrelevant ⚠️ AI DETECTION RESULTS: Detailed AI Detection per Question: No AI detected in any answers TECHNICAL SKILLS TO EVALUATE (8 total): 1. JavaScript (Category: Programming, Required: Yes) 2. Collaboration (Category: Soft Skill, Required: Yes) 3. Communication (Category: Soft Skill, Required: Yes) 4. Problem Solving (Category: Soft Skill, Required: Yes) 5. Code Review (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) 6. Full Stack Development (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) 7. Modern Frameworks (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) 8. Security and Data Protection (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) For EACH skill, provide: - A score from 0-10 based on evidence in answers - Specific evidence/quotes from the candidate's responses - Assessment of proficiency level CUSTOM ASSESSMENT QUESTIONS TO EVALUATE (3 total): CQ1 [Open-Ended] [Weight: 1.00x] (ID: 82): Question: Describe a time when you had to optimize a web application for better performance. What steps did you take and what was the outcome? Max Score: 100 Answer: asdcs CQ2 [Open-Ended] [Weight: 1.00x] (ID: 83): Question: Reflect on a project where you had to collaborate with a cross-functional team. How did you ensure effective communication and what impact did it have on the project's success? Max Score: 100 Answer: NO ANSWER PROVIDED CQ3 [Code Challenge] [Weight: 2.00x] (ID: 84): Question: Given an array of integers, return the sum of the unique numbers in the array. A number is considered unique if it appears exactly once in the array. Max Score: 100 Answer: ssssss CUSTOM QUESTION SCORING INSTRUCTIONS: - Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly - For coding/SQL questions: Evaluate correctness, efficiency, best practices, edge cases - For open-ended/writing: Evaluate clarity, depth, relevance, structure - For video responses: Return score as null and feedback \"Pending manual review - recruiter must watch and score the video submission\". Video responses CANNOT be auto-scored. - For Excel tasks: Evaluate formula correctness, data analysis approach - For situational judgment: Evaluate decision-making, reasoning, practical application - Score each on 0-100 scale with detailed feedback (except video which should be null) CRITICAL: ALL TEXT FEEDBACK MUST BE IN English. JOB/ASSESSMENT: Full Stack Developer CANDIDATE: Muhammad Muneeb CASE STUDY QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS: Q1: What strategies would you propose to optimize the current application architecture to enhance system availability and reduce latency? A: asdas NOTE: Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly. RETURN ONLY VALID JSON (no markdown, no explanations): { \"overall_score\": <0-100>, \"rating\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"ai_detected\": false, \"recruiter_feedback\": \"<Comprehensive feedback in English>\", \"question_scores\": [{ \"question_number\": 1, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" }], \"skill_scores\": [{ \"skill_name\": \"JavaScript\", \"category\": \"Programming\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Collaboration\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Communication\