{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767091445719,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767091449729,"prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and mid-level-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: MID-LEVEL - Job Title: Full Stack Developer - Key Responsibilities (8 identified): • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: ANALYTICAL VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: analytical - Difficulty: 1 - undefined - Duration: 60 minutes - Target Length: words - Questions: 300-500 ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"Company XYZ\", \"Industry\": \"Software Development\", \"FoundedYear\": \"2005\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"500+\", \"Offices\": \"3\", \"Countries\": \"2\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": [\"Full Stack Development\", \"Software Solutions\"], \"MainProductsServices\": [\"Client-side applications\", \"Server-side applications\"] }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"To deliver innovative and high-quality software solutions.\", \"CoreValues\": [\"Innovation\", \"Quality\", \"Collaboration\"], \"CompanyCulture\": \"Dynamic and collaborative environment\" } }, \"ar\": { \"CompanyOverview\": { \"CompanyName\": \"شركة XYZ\", \"Industry\": \"تطوير البرمجيات\", \"FoundedYear\": \"2005\" }, \"CompanyScale\": { \"Employees\": \"أكثر من 500\", \"Offices\": \"3\", \"Countries\": \"2\" }, \"ExpertiseAndCoreBusiness\": { \"Specializations\": [\"تطوير برمجيات كاملة\", \"حلول برمجيات\"], \"MainProductsServices\": [\"تطبيقات واجهة العميل\", \"تطبيقات جهة الخادم\"] }, \"CompanyCultureMissionValues\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"تقديم حلول برمجيات مبتكرة وعالية الجودة.\", \"CoreValues\": [\"الابتكار\", \"الجودة\", \"التعاون\"], \"CompanyCulture\": \"بيئة ديناميكية وتعاونية\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Company XYZ is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Full Stack Developer at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION ( words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Full Stack Developer in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Full Stack Developer at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Full Stack Developer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 60 \"case_study_type\": \"analytical\", \"difficulty_level\": \"1\", \"num_questions\": 300-500, \"content_length\": \"\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Full Stack Developer\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"mid-level\", \"document_context_used\": true } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE LANGUAGE OR PLACEHOLDER TEXT ✓ REFERENCE SPECIFIC METRICS/NUMBERS FROM THE DESCRIPTION ✓ BUILD ON SCENARIO CONTEXT - NOT GENERIC ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE 2-4 DETAILED SENTENCES ✓ NO DIFFICULTY LEVEL INDICATORS IN QUESTION TEXT ✓ QUESTIONS SHOULD BUILD IN DEPTH/COMPLEXITY ✓ VARIANT FOCUS IS EMBEDDED IN QUESTION DESIGN ===== VALIDATION CHECKLIST ===== ✓ Description starts with company name and what they do ✓ Description builds: Company → Scale → Expertise → Challenge ✓ NO role assignment in description section ✓ Instructions starts with \"As the Full Stack Developer...\" ✓ All content is specific to Full Stack Developer role ✓ Industry terminology used: tech ✓ Appropriate seniority level: mid-level ✓ 300-500 specific questions included ✓ All questions reference specific scenario details ✓ Tables have realistic, industry-appropriate data ✓ Variant 1 focus embedded in scenario ✓ Industry terminology used correctly ✓ Appropriate for mid-level level ✓ Valid JSON only ✓ Both sections are cohesive and interconnected ✓ Both English and Arabic sections complete ✓ Metrics are realistic for tech industry ===== MANDATORY BILINGUAL REQUIREMENTS ===== - BOTH 'en' AND 'ar' SECTIONS MUST BE PRESENT AND FULLY POPULATED. - The 'ar' section MUST be a proper Arabic translation of the corresponding 'en' fields (questions arrays and tables MUST match lengths and structure). - DO NOT RETURN PARTIAL ARABIC TRANSLATIONS. If Arabic cannot be provided, include a top-level 'error' field with value 'MISSING_AR'. - RETURN ONLY VALID JSON. NO MARKDOWN, NO EXPLANATIONS."}
