{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767093779830,"prompt":"You are a STRICT and CRITICAL Technical Recruiter evaluating case study submissions. CRITICAL EVALUATION STANDARDS: - ONE-LINERS: Maximum 30/100 - VAGUE ANSWERS: Maximum 50/100 - MISSING PRIORITIZATION: -20 minimum - NO METRICS: -15 points - NO IMPLEMENTATION: -15 points SCORING RUBRIC: - 90-100: Exceptional - Detailed, strategic, prioritized, with metrics and implementation - 75-89: Good - Comprehensive with most elements - 60-74: Acceptable - Main points but lacks depth - 40-59: Poor - Superficial, missing elements - 0-39: Unacceptable - One-liners or irrelevant ⚠️ AI DETECTION RESULTS: Detailed AI Detection per Question: No AI detected in any answers TECHNICAL SKILLS TO EVALUATE (8 total): 1. JavaScript (Category: Programming, Required: Yes) 2. Collaboration (Category: Soft Skill, Required: Yes) 3. Communication (Category: Soft Skill, Required: Yes) 4. Problem Solving (Category: Soft Skill, Required: Yes) 5. Code Review (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) 6. Full Stack Development (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) 7. Modern Frameworks (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) 8. Security and Data Protection (Category: Technical, Required: Yes) For EACH skill, provide: - A score from 0-10 based on evidence in answers - Specific evidence/quotes from the candidate's responses - Assessment of proficiency level CUSTOM ASSESSMENT QUESTIONS TO EVALUATE (2 total): CQ1 [Code Challenge] [Weight: 2.00x] (ID: 93): Question: Write a function that takes a string as input and returns the string reversed. Max Score: 100 Answer: NO ANSWER PROVIDED CQ2 [Code Challenge] [Weight: 2.00x] (ID: 94): Question: Write a function that takes an array of integers and returns the sum of its elements. Max Score: 100 Answer: NO ANSWER PROVIDED CUSTOM QUESTION SCORING INSTRUCTIONS: - Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly - For coding/SQL questions: Evaluate correctness, efficiency, best practices, edge cases - For open-ended/writing: Evaluate clarity, depth, relevance, structure - For video responses: Return score as null and feedback \"Pending manual review - recruiter must watch and score the video submission\". Video responses CANNOT be auto-scored. - For Excel tasks: Evaluate formula correctness, data analysis approach - For situational judgment: Evaluate decision-making, reasoning, practical application - Score each on 0-100 scale with detailed feedback (except video which should be null) CRITICAL: ALL TEXT FEEDBACK MUST BE IN English. JOB/ASSESSMENT: Full Stack Developer CANDIDATE: Muhammad Muneeb CASE STUDY QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS: Q1: What immediate steps would you take to assess and address the current system outages impacting the system availability? A: sadfads Q2: How would you prioritize tasks to improve application performance and reduce latency given the current deployment frequency? A: NO ANSWER NOTE: Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly. RETURN ONLY VALID JSON (no markdown, no explanations): { \"overall_score\": <0-100>, \"rating\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"ai_detected\": false, \"recruiter_feedback\": \"<Comprehensive feedback in English>\", \"question_scores\": [{ \"question_number\": 1, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" },{ \"question_number\": 2, \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\" }], \"skill_scores\": [{ \"skill_name\": \"JavaScript\", \"category\": \"Programming\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Collaboration\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Communication\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Problem Solving\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Code Review\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Full Stack Development\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Modern Frameworks\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Security and Data Protection\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in English>\", \"is_required\": true }], \"psychometric_scores\": [], \"custom_question_scores\": [{ \"question_id\": 93, \"question_type\": \"coding\", \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\", \"code_quality\": \"<Evaluation of code quality>\" },{ \"question_id\": 94, \"question_type\": \"coding\", \"score\": <0-100>, \"feedback\": \"<Detailed feedback in English>\", \"code_quality\": \"<Evaluation of code quality>\" }], \"final_recommendation\": \"<Hire|Interview|Review|Reject>\" }"}
