{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767094641693,"prompt":"You are an expert ATS (Applicant Tracking System) analyzer. Analyze how well this candidate's CV matches the job requirements. 🎯 JOB DETAILS: Title: Full Stack Developer Description: We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Key Responsibilities: • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends Department: Development Experience Level: mid Min Experience: 3 years Max Experience: 5 years 🛠️ REQUIRED SKILLS: - JavaScript (Programming) - REQUIRED - Collaboration (Soft Skill) - REQUIRED - Communication (Soft Skill) - REQUIRED - Problem Solving (Soft Skill) - REQUIRED - Code Review (Technical) - REQUIRED - Full Stack Development (Technical) - REQUIRED - Modern Frameworks (Technical) - REQUIRED - Security and Data Protection (Technical) - REQUIRED 📄 CANDIDATE CV: HUNZLA ABBASI +92-334-[REDACTED_NUM] [EMAIL] LinkedIn Github Portfolio PROFILE SUMMARY Enthusiastic and detail-oriented Full-Stack Developer and aspiring AI/ML Engineer with over 6 months of experience in JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, and REST API development. Proficient in building scalable, end-to-end web applications with a strong emphasis on code performance, security, and user experience. Skilled in Python-based machine learning tools such as Pandas, Scikit-learn, and PyTorch, with hands-on experience in data preprocessing, model training, and deployment. Fast learner, effective communicator, and a collaborative team player passionate about leveraging AI-driven solutions to solve real-world problems. EDUCATION Air University Sep 2021 – July 2025 Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering Islamabad, Pakistan CGPA: 3.20/4 • Relevant Coursework: Data Structures, Software Engineering, Algorithms Analysis, Operating Systems, Database Management Systems, Artificial Intelligence, Information Security, Probability and Statistics, Computer Architecture, Web Programming, Machine Learning, Natural Language Processing and Computer Networking. TECHNICAL SKILLS Full-Stack Development: JavaScript, ReactJS, Next.js, Node.js, Express.js, HTML5, CSS3, Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap Backend & Databases: PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MySQL, MS Access, REST APIs, Firebase UI/UX & Design Tools: Figma Version Control & Dev Tools: Git, Linux, Google Colab Testing & QA: Manual Testing, Automation Testing, JUnit, Jest Additional Skills: Python (NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn, PyTorch), Supervised & Unsupervised Learning, Neural Networks, Model Evaluation, Data Preprocessing, ServiceNow EXPERIENCE Ideation Oct 2025 – Present Junior Software Engineer Islamabad, Pakistan • Contributing to the development of full-stack web applications using React.js, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB to build scalable and responsive solutions. • Developed and deployed Merit HR Platform, an AI-powered human resource management system utilizing machine learning models for intelligent recruitment and performance analytics. • Improved backend efficiency and API performance, achieving a 30% faster response time and better scalability across modules. Air University June 2024 – Aug 2024 Project Intern Islamabad, Pakistan • Built a responsive web app using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, and PostgreSQL. • Integrated RESTful APIs and optimized backend communication for scalability. • Designed architecture to support future ML-based recommendation features. PROJECTS TaskKar (FYP) | Next.js, Prisma, PostgreSQL, Tailwind CSS, Node.js • Built a service marketplace web app with scalable backend and responsive frontend. • Implemented smart task matching features and explored ML-based algorithms to recommend service providers. Secure Link | Flutter, OVPN Servers • Developed a secure VPN app for Android with a modern user interface and over 90 servers. • Utilized OVPN servers to ensure reliable and fast connections. ML-Powered Resume Screener | Python, NLP (spaCy, Scikit-learn), Streamlit • Programmed an intelligent system to extract and match resume keywords to job descriptions. • Used TF-IDF and cosine similarity for semantic matching and ranking. AI-Powered Mock Interview Platform | Next.js, Tailwind CSS, Gemini API, PostgreSQL, Drizzle ORM • Developed an AI-driven mock interview platform that simulates real-world interview scenarios for job seekers. • Integrated Gemini API to generate personalized interview questions and feedback based on user profiles. CERTIFICATIONS HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for Web Developers – Johns Hopkins University (Coursera) Aug 2023 ServiceNow ITSM Bootcamp – Zones IT Solutions Feb 2025 Analyze the match and return ONLY this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text): { \"overall_match_score\": <0-100>, \"match_level\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"skills_match\": [ { \"skill_name\": \"<skill name>\", \"found_in_cv\": <true|false>, \"evidence\": \"<brief quote or evidence from CV>\", \"is_required\": <true|false> } ], \"experience_match\": <0-100>, \"experience_evidence\": \"<evidence of relevant experience>\", \"education_match\": <0-100>, \"education_evidence\": \"<education background>\", \"strengths\": [ \"<strength 1>\", \"<strength 2>\", \"<strength 3>\" ], \"gaps\": [ \"<gap 1>\", \"<gap 2>\" ], \"summary\": \"<2-3 sentence summary of the match>\", \"recommendation\": \"<Strong Hire|Interview|Review Manually|Reject>\" } SCORING RULES: - 80-100: Excellent match (most/all required skills + relevant experience) - 60-79: Good match (some required skills + relevant experience) - 40-59: Fair match (few skills or limited experience) - 0-39: Poor match (major gaps in requirements) Be objective and evidence-based. Return ONLY valid JSON."}
