{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767096308281,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] NXT LABS, a leading technology firm based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, is looking for a Senior Database Engineer specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. This full-time role involves managing and optimizing database systems, including MySQL and PostgreSQL, implementing robust disaster recovery solutions, and managing cloud databases on AWS and Azure. The ideal candidate will have a minimum of 5 years of experience in database administration with a strong focus on performance tuning. NXT LABS offers a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
