{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767162956666,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional assessment questions for job candidates. IMPORTANT: If ADDITIONAL CONTEXT includes a CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES, reference those directly in question stems/options (mention table titles, metrics or specific numbers where applicable). JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions Description: NXT LABS, a leading technology firm based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, is looking for a Senior Database Engineer specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. This full-time role involves managing and optimizing database systems, including MySQL and PostgreSQL, implementing robust disaster recovery solutions, and managing cloud databases on AWS and Azure. The ideal candidate will have a minimum of 5 years of experience in database administration with a strong focus on performance tuning. NXT LABS offers a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth. Key Responsibilities: 1. Configure, manage, and optimize MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. 2. Design and implement disaster recovery strategies. 3. Oversee cloud database management on AWS and Azure. 4. Conduct database performance tuning and optimization. 5. Collaborate with the development team to support database requirements. 6. Ensure data security and integrity across all database platforms. 7. Monitor database performance and troubleshoot issues promptly. ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: CONTEXT USAGE INSTRUCTION: Use the CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES below as the primary source when generating module questions; reference specific metrics, table titles, and named entities when relevant. CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION: NXT LABS is a technology company specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. They manage database systems and cloud databases on AWS and Azure. Based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, NXT LABS is a leading