ement and cloud database solutions on AWS and Azure. The company has a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth, positioning itself as a leading technology firm in the region. However, NXT LABS is currently dealing with operational challenges related to optimizing their cloud database infrastructure. The company has observed a decline in system availability and an increase in incident response time, impacting their overall service reliability. With a goal to enhance performance and ensure seamless database operations, NXT LABS aims to address these issues swiftly to uphold their reputation for high-quality service. TABLE SUMMARIES: - Current Metrics & Performance: columns: Metric | Current Value | Target | Variance | Trend. sample_rows: {\"metric_name\":\"System Availability\",\"current_value\":\"97.5%\",\"target_value\":\"99.9%\",\"variance\":\"-2.4%\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Incident Response Time\",\"current_value\":\"10 minutes\",\"target_value\":\"5 minutes\",\"variance\":\"+5 minutes\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Database Latency\",\"current_value\":\"120ms\",\"target_value\":\"80ms\",\"variance\":\"+40ms\",\"trend\":\"→ Stable\"} - Situation/Context Data: columns: Item | Status | Impact Level | Details. sample_rows: {\"item\":\"Cloud Database Integration\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"impact\":\"High\",\"notes\":\"Requires optimization to reduce latency\"} ; {\"item\":\"Disaster Recovery Plan\",\"status\":\"Pending\",\"impact\":\"Critical\",\"notes\":\"Needs updating to ensure rapid recovery\"} - Available Resources & Constraints: columns: Resource Type | Availability | Cost/Effort | Constraint. sample_rows: {\"resource_type\":\"Development Team\",\"availability\":\"Fully available\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Included\",\"constraint\":\"Time-bound\"} ; {\"resource_type\":\"Cloud Tools\",\"availability\":\"Limited\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Additional budget needed\",\"constraint\":\"Capacity limit