{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767163129290,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional situational judgment tests for job candidates. JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions Description: NXT LABS, a leading technology firm based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, is looking for a Senior Database Engineer specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. This full-time role involves managing and optimizing database systems, including MySQL and PostgreSQL, implementing robust disaster recovery solutions, and managing cloud databases on AWS and Azure. The ideal candidate will have a minimum of 5 years of experience in database administration with a strong focus on performance tuning. NXT LABS offers a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth. Key Responsibilities: 1. Configure, manage, and optimize MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. 2. Design and implement disaster recovery strategies. 3. Oversee cloud database management on AWS and Azure. 4. Conduct database performance tuning and optimization. 5. Collaborate with the development team to support database requirements. 6. Ensure data security and integrity across all database platforms. 7. Monitor database performance and troubleshoot issues promptly. ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: CONTEXT USAGE INSTRUCTION: Use the CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES below as the primary source when generating module questions; reference specific metrics, table titles, and named entities when relevant. CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION: NXT LABS is a technology company specializing in high availability, disaster recovery, and cloud solutions. Operating since its founding, NXT LABS is based in Rawalpindi, Pakistan, focusing on providing advanced database systems management and cloud database solutions on AWS and Azure. The company has a dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth, positioning itself as a leading technology firm in the region. However, NXT LABS is currently dealing with operational challenges related to optimizing their cloud database infrastructure. The company has observed a decline in system availability and an increase in incident response time, impacting their overall service reliability. With a goal to enhance performance and ensure seamless database operations, NXT LABS aims to address these issues swiftly to uphold their reputation for high-quality service. TABLE SUMMARIES: - Current Metrics & Performance: columns: Metric | Current Value | Target | Variance | Trend. sample_rows: {\"metric_name\":\"System Availability\",\"current_value\":\"97.5%\",\"target_value\":\"99.9%\",\"variance\":\"-2.4%\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Incident Response Time\",\"current_value\":\"10 minutes\",\"target_value\":\"5 minutes\",\"variance\":\"+5 minutes\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Database Latency\",\"current_value\":\"120ms\",\"target_value\":\"80ms\",\"variance\":\"+40ms\",\"trend\":\"→ Stable\"} - Situation/Context Data: columns: Item | Status | Impact Level | Details. sample_rows: {\"item\":\"Cloud Database Integration\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"impact\":\"High\",\"notes\":\"Requires optimization to reduce latency\"} ; {\"item\":\"Disaster Recovery Plan\",\"status\":\"Pending\",\"impact\":\"Critical\",\"notes\":\"Needs updating to ensure rapid recovery\"} - Available Resources & Constraints: columns: Resource Type | Availability | Cost/Effort | Constraint. sample_rows: {\"resource_type\":\"Development Team\",\"availability\":\"Fully available\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Included\",\"constraint\":\"Time-bound\"} ; {\"resource_type\":\"Cloud Tools\",\"availability\":\"Limited\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Additional budget needed\",\"constraint\":\"Capacity limited\"} FALLBACK CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company\": { \"name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"industry\": \"Technology\", \"foundedYear\": null, \"scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": [\"Rawalpindi, Pakistan\"], \"countries\": [\"Pakistan\"] }, \"expertise\": { \"specializations\": [\"High availability\", \"Disaster recovery\", \"Cloud solutions\"], \"mainProductsServices\": [\"Database systems management\", \"Disaster recovery solutions\", \"Cloud databases on AWS and Azure\"] }, \"missionStatement\": null, \"coreValues\": null, \"culture\": \"Dynamic work environment with ample opportunities for professional growth\", \"marketPosition\": \"Leading technology firm\" } }, \"ar\": { \"company\": { \"name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"industry\": \"التكنولوجيا\", \"foundedYear\": null, \"scale\": { \"employees\": null, \"offices\": [\"روالبندي، باكستان\"], \"countries\": [\"باكستان\"] }, \"expertise\": { \"specializations\": [\"التوافر العالي\", \"استعادة الكوارث\", \"حلول السحابة\"], \"mainProductsServices\": [\"إدارة أنظمة قواعد البيانات\", \"حلول استعادة الكوارث\", \"قواعد البيانات السحابية على AWS و Azure\"] }, \"missionStatement\": null, \"coreValues\": null, \"culture\": \"بيئة عمل ديناميكية مع فرص كبيرة للنمو المهني\", \"marketPosition\": \"شركة رائدة في مجال التكنولوجيا\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === TASK: Generate 2 situational judgment scenarios to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: MEDIUM - Create realistic workplace scenarios - Include 4 response options with different effectiveness levels - Avoid obviously wrong or right answers Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"scenarios\": [ { \"scenario_en\": \"Detailed workplace scenario description\", \"scenario_ar\": \"وصف سيناريو العمل بالتفصيل\", \"question_en\": \"What would you do in this situation?\", \"question_ar\": \"ماذا ستفعل في هذا الموقف؟\", \"options\": [ { \"id\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"Response option A\", \"text_ar\": \"خيار الاستجابة أ\", \"effectiveness_score\": 4, \"feedback_en\": \"Why this is most effective\", \"feedback_ar\": \"لماذا هذا الأكثر فعالية\" }, { \"id\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"Response option B\", \"text_ar\": \"خيار الاستجابة ب\", \"effectiveness_score\": 3, \"feedback_en\": \"Why this is somewhat effective\", \"feedback_ar\": \"لماذا هذا فعال إلى حد ما\" }, { \"id\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"Response option C\", \"text_ar\": \"خيار الاستجابة ج\", \"effectiveness_score\": 2, \"feedback_en\": \"Why this is less effective\", \"feedback_ar\": \"لماذا هذا أقل فعالية\" }, { \"id\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"Response option D\", \"text_ar\": \"خيار الاستجابة د\", \"effectiveness_score\": 1, \"feedback_en\": \"Why this is least effective\", \"feedback_ar\": \"لماذا هذا الأقل فعالية\" } ], \"competencies_assessed\": [\"leadership\", \"communication\", \"problem-solving\"], \"difficulty\": \"medium\" } ] }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767175137434,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767175140412,"prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and mid-level-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: MID-LEVEL - Job Title: Full Stack Developer - Key Responsibilities (8 identified): • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: ANALYTICAL VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: analytical - Difficulty: medium - Create realistic scenarios with 3-4 interconnected challenges. Include ambiguous elements requiring judgment. - Duration: 60 minutes - Target Length: 300-500 words - Modules: mcq: 5 - Module Breakdown: mcq: 5 MODULE INSTRUCTIONS: For each selected module, generate the specified number of questions tied to the case study scenario. Annotate each question with its module type and provide module-specific metadata (e.g., MCQs must have 4 options and one correct answer; coding challenges must include test cases and sample input/output; video responses must include time limits and evaluation criteria). Ensure the overall number of questions matches the module breakdown. ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company_overview\": { \"company_name\": \"Not Provided\", \"what_they_do\": \"Software Development\", \"founded_year\": \"Not Provided\" }, \"company_scale\": { \"offices\": \"Islamabad, Pakistan\", \"team_size\": \"Not Provided\", \"global_presence\": \"Not Provided\" }, \"expertise_and_core_business\": { \"expertise_specializations\": \"Designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications\", \"main_products_services\": \"Software solutions\" }, \"company_culture_mission_values\": { \"mission_statement\": \"Not Provided\", \"core_values\": \"Not Provided\", \"company_culture\": \"Dynamic development team\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"Not Provided\" } }, \"ar\": { \"company_overview\": { \"company_name\": \"غير متوفر\", \"what_they_do\": \"تطوير البرمجيات\", \"founded_year\": \"غير متوفر\" }, \"company_scale\": { \"offices\": \"إسلام آباد، باكستان\", \"team_size\": \"غير متوفر\", \"global_presence\": \"غير متوفر\" }, \"expertise_and_core_business\": { \"expertise_specializations\": \"تصميم وتنفيذ التطبيقات على جانب العميل والخادم\", \"main_products_services\": \"حلول برمجية\" }, \"company_culture_mission_values\": { \"mission_statement\": \"غير متوفر\", \"core_values\": \"غير متوفر\", \"company_culture\": \"فريق تطوير ديناميكي\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"غير متوفر\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: IMPORTANT: If a COMPANY BACKGROUND block is provided in the ORGANIZATION CONTEXT above, you MUST use the EXACT company name found there. The description MUST begin with the company name (for example: \"Acme Corp is a ...\"). Do NOT use the placeholder 'Company XYZ' when the actual company name is available in the context. If the company name cannot be determined from the provided content, do not invent one — instead start descriptions with 'The company' (avoid using 'Company XYZ' placeholder in that case). PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Company XYZ is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Full Stack Developer at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION (300-500 words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Full Stack Developer in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Full Stack Developer at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Full Stack Developer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 60 \"case_study_type\": \"analytical\", \"difficulty_level\": \"medium\", \"num_questions\": 5, \"module_breakdown\": {\"mcqCount\":5,\"openEndedCount\":2,\"videoResponseCount\":1,\"codingChallengeCount\":1,\"sqlProblemCount\":1,\"excelTaskCount\":1,\"writingExerciseCount\":1,\"situationalJudgmentCount\":2}, \"module_breakdown\": {\"mcqCount\":5,\"openEndedCount\":2,\"videoResponseCount\":1,\"codingChallengeCount\":1,\"sqlProblemCount\":1,\"excelTaskCount\":1,\"writingExerciseCount\":1,\"situationalJudgmentCount\":2}, \"content_length\": \"300-500\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Full Stack Developer\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"mid-level\", \"document_context_used\": true } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE"}
