{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767175160576,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional assessment questions for job candidates. IMPORTANT: If ADDITIONAL CONTEXT includes a CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES, reference those directly in question stems/options (mention table titles, metrics or specific numbers where applicable). JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Full Stack Developer Description: We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Key Responsibilities: • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: CONTEXT USAGE INSTRUCTION: Use the CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES below as the primary source when generating module questions; reference specific metrics, table titles, and named entities when relevant. CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION: The company is a tech company that specializes in software development. It designs and implements client-side and server-side applications, providing comprehensive software solutions. Currently, the company operates an office in Islamabad, Pakistan. However, the company is dealing with several operational challenges in the tech infrastructure domain. Frequent system outages, performance degradation, and technical debt are impacting the company's growth trajectory and client satisfaction. The current deployment frequency is low, and the incident response time is higher than industry standards. These issues have led to a decline in system availability, which is affecting overall productivity and client trust. The company aims to enhance its CI/CD pipeline, improve code quality, and address these challenges to maintain its competitive edge. TABLE SUMMARIES: - Current Metrics & Performance: columns: Metric | Current Value | Target | Variance | Trend. sample_rows: {\"metric_name\":\"Deployment Frequency\",\"current_value\":\"3 times/week\",\"target_value\":\"5 times/week\",\"variance\":\"-40%\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Incident Response Time\",\"current_value\":\"2 hours\",\"target_value\":\"1 hour\",\"variance\":\"-100%\",\"trend\":\"↑ Improving\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"System Availability\",\"current_value\":\"95%\",\"target_value\":\"99.9%\",\"variance\":\"-4.9%\",\"trend\":\"→ Stable\"} - Situation/Context Data: columns: Item | Status | Impact Level | Details. sample_rows: {\"item\":\"System Outages\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"impact\":\"Critical\",\"notes\":\"Causing significant disruptions\"} ; {\"item\":\"Performance Degradation\",\"status\":\"Pending\",\"impact\":\"High\",\"notes\":\"Affects user experience\"} - Available Resources & Constraints: columns: Resource Type | Availability | Cost/Effort | Constraint. sample_rows: {\"resource_type\":\"Development Team\",\"availability\":\"Fully available\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Included\",\"constraint\":\"Time-bound\"} ; {\"resource_type\":\"Infrastructure Budget\",\"availability\":\"Limited\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Additional budget needed\",\"constraint\":\"Capacity limited\"} FALLBACK CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company_overview\": { \"company_name\": \"Not Provided\", \"what_they_do\": \"Software Development\", \"founded_year\": \"Not Provided\" }, \"company_scale\": { \"offices\": \"Islamabad, Pakistan\", \"team_size\": \"Not Provided\", \"global_presence\": \"Not Provided\" }, \"expertise_and_core_business\": { \"expertise_specializations\": \"Designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications\", \"main_products_services\": \"Software solutions\" }, \"company_culture_mission_values\": { \"mission_statement\": \"Not Provided\", \"core_values\": \"Not Provided\", \"company_culture\": \"Dynamic development team\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"Not Provided\" } }, \"ar\": { \"company_overview\": { \"company_name\": \"غير متوفر\", \"what_they_do\": \"تطوير البرمجيات\", \"founded_year\": \"غير متوفر\" }, \"company_scale\": { \"offices\": \"إسلام آباد، باكستان\", \"team_size\": \"غير متوفر\", \"global_presence\": \"غير متوفر\" }, \"expertise_and_core_business\": { \"expertise_specializations\": \"تصميم وتنفيذ التطبيقات على جانب العميل والخادم\", \"main_products_services\": \"حلول برمجية\" }, \"company_culture_mission_values\": { \"mission_statement\": \"غير متوفر\", \"core_values\": \"غير متوفر\", \"company_culture\": \"فريق تطوير ديناميكي\", \"market_position_achievements\": \"غير متوفر\" } } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === TASK: Generate 5 multiple choice questions to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: MEDIUM - Each question must have exactly 4 options (A, B, C, D) - Only ONE correct answer per question - Questions should be relevant to the job role - Include mix of knowledge, scenario, and application questions - Provide clear explanation for the correct answer Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"questions\": [ { \"question_en\": \"English question text\", \"question_ar\": \"نص السؤال بالعربية\", \"options\": [ { \"id\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"Option A in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار أ بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": false }, { \"id\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"Option B in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار ب بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": true }, { \"id\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"Option C in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار ج بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": false }, { \"id\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"Option D in English\", \"text_ar\": \"الخيار د بالعربية\", \"is_correct\": false } ], \"explanation_en\": \"Explanation why B is correct\", \"explanation_ar\": \"شرح لماذا ب هو الصحيح\", \"difficulty\": \"medium\", \"category\": \"technical/behavioral/analytical\" } ] }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767179868418,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767179872275,"prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and mid-level-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: MID-LEVEL - Job Title: Full Stack Developer - Key Responsibilities (8 identified): • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: ANALYTICAL VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: analytical - Difficulty: medium - Create realistic scenarios with 3-4 interconnected challenges. Include ambiguous elements requiring judgment. - Duration: 60 minutes - Target Length: 300-500 words - Modules: codingChallenge: 1, writingExercise: 1 - Module Breakdown: codingChallenge: 1, writingExercise: 1 MODULE INSTRUCTIONS: For each selected module, generate the specified number of questions tied to the case study scenario. Annotate each question with its module type and provide module-specific metadata (e.g., MCQs must have 4 options and one correct answer; coding challenges must include test cases and sample input/output; video responses must include time limits and evaluation criteria). Ensure the overall number of questions matches the module breakdown. ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company\": { \"name\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"industry\": \"Software Development\", \"founded\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"scale\": { \"employees\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"offices\": \"Islamabad, Pakistan\", \"countries\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"expertise\": { \"specializations\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"products_services\": \"Client-side and server-side applications\" }, \"mission\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"core_values\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"culture\": \"Dynamic development team\", \"market_position\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"ar\": { \"company\": { \"name\": \"غير مذكور\", \"industry\": \"تطوير البرمجيات\", \"founded\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"scale\": { \"employees\": \"غير مذكور\", \"offices\": \"إسلام آباد، باكستان\", \"countries\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"expertise\": { \"specializations\": \"غير مذكور\", \"products_services\": \"تطبيقات الواجهة الأمامية والخلفية\" }, \"mission\": \"غير مذكور\", \"core_values\": \"غير مذكور\", \"culture\": \"فريق تطوير ديناميكي\", \"market_position\": \"غير مذكور\" } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: IMPORTANT: If a COMPANY BACKGROUND block is provided in the ORGANIZATION CONTEXT above, you MUST use the EXACT company name found there. The description MUST begin with the company name (for example: \"Acme Corp is a ...\"). Do NOT use the placeholder 'Company XYZ' when the actual company name is available in the context. If the company name cannot be determined from the provided content, do not invent one — instead start descriptions with 'The company' (avoid using 'Company XYZ' placeholder in that case). PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Company XYZ is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Full Stack Developer at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION (300-500 words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Full Stack Developer in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Full Stack Developer at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Full Stack Developer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤال 1 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 2 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 3 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 4 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 5 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 6 محدد لهذا السيناريو\", \"السؤال 7 محدد لهذا السيناريو\"], \"tables\": [{\"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"المقاييس الحالية والأداء\", \"columns\": [], \"rows\": []}] }, \"duration_minutes\": 60 \"case_study_type\": \"analytical\", \"difficulty_level\": \"medium\", \"num_questions\": 2, \"module_breakdown\": {\"mcqCount\":5,\"openEndedCount\":2,\"videoResponseCount\":1,\"codingChallengeCount\":1,\"sqlProblemCount\":1,\"excelTaskCount\":1,\"writingExerciseCount\":1,\"situationalJudgmentCount\":2}, \"module_breakdown\": {\"mcqCount\":5,\"openEndedCount\":2,\"videoResponseCount\":1,\"codingChallengeCount\":1,\"sqlProblemCount\":1,\"excelTaskCount\":1,\"writingExerciseCount\":1,\"situationalJudgmentCount\":2}, \"content_length\": \"300-500\", \"variant_number\": 1, \"variant_focus\": \"operational_challenge\", \"job_title\": \"Full Stack Developer\", \"industry\": \"tech\", \"seniority_level\": \"mid-level\", \"document_context_used\": true } ===== CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR QUESTIONS ===== ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE UNIQUE TO THIS SPECIFIC SCENARIO ✓ NO TEMPLATE LANGUAGE OR PLACEHOLDER TEXT ✓ REFERENCE SPECIFIC METRICS/NUMBERS FROM THE DESCRIPTION ✓ BUILD ON SCENARIO CONTEXT - NOT GENERIC ✓ EACH QUESTION MUST BE 2-4 DETAILED SENTENCES ✓ NO DIFFICULTY LEVEL INDICATORS IN QUESTION TEXT ✓ QUESTIONS SHOULD BUILD IN DEPTH"}
