{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767262897295,"prompt":"You are an expert at extracting and structuring company background information from text. TASK: Extract comprehensive company information and structure it for a case study. IMPORTANT - Follow this EXACT narrative sequence: 1. FIRST: Company overview (name, what they do, when founded) 2. SECOND: Company scale (offices, team size, global presence) 3. THIRD: Expertise and core business (products, services, specialties) 4. FOURTH: Company culture, mission, and values This sequence ensures the narrative flows naturally BEFORE introducing a role or scenario. Extract these details in order: - Company name (exact) - What they do (business type/industry) - Founded year/history - Scale (employees, offices, countries) - Expertise/specializations - Main products/services - Mission statement - Core values - Company culture - Market position/achievements Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned. If not mentioned, skip it. CONTEXT: [SOURCE: Job Description] We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Return a comprehensive background paragraph (200-350 words) following the sequence above. Structure: Company → Scale → Expertise → Culture. Just return the text directly, no JSON, no markdown, no formatting."}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767262900249,"prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and mid-level-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: MID-LEVEL - Job Title: Full Stack Developer - Key Responsibilities (8 identified): • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: TECHNICAL VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: technical - Difficulty: medium - Create realistic scenarios with 3-4 interconnected challenges. Include ambiguous elements requiring judgment. - Duration: 60 minutes - Target Length: 600-900 words - Modules: openEnded: 2, codingChallenge: 1 - Module Breakdown: openEnded: 2, codingChallenge: 1 MODULE INSTRUCTIONS: For each selected module, generate the specified number of questions tied to the case study scenario. Annotate each question with its module type and provide module-specific metadata (e.g., MCQs must have 4 options and one correct answer; coding challenges must include test cases and sample input/output; video responses must include time limits and evaluation criteria). Ensure the overall number of questions matches the module breakdown. ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"Company\": { \"Name\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Industry\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Founded\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"Scale\": { \"Employees\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Offices\": \"Islamabad, Pakistan\", \"Countries\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"Expertise\": { \"Specializations\": \"Designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"Software solutions\" }, \"Culture\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"CoreValues\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"Dynamic development team\" }, \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"ar\": { \"Company\": { \"Name\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Industry\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Founded\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"Scale\": { \"Employees\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Offices\": \"إسلام آباد، باكستان\", \"Countries\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"Expertise\": { \"Specializations\": \"تصميم وتنفيذ تطبيقات الجهة العميل والخادم\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"حلول البرمجيات\" }, \"Culture\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"غير مذكور\", \"CoreValues\": \"غير مذكور\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"فريق تطوير ديناميكي\" }, \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"غير مذكور\" } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === === PSYCHOMETRIC ASSESSMENT INTEGRATION === Include psychometric evaluation elements for: cognitiveAbility, problemSolving COGNITIVE ABILITY ASSESSMENT: - Primary Focus: Measures analytical thinking, logical reasoning, pattern recognition, and mental processing speed. Evaluate how the candidate breaks down complex information. - Probe with: How do you approach complex analytical problems? / Walk through your logical reasoning / How would you break down this ambiguous situation? / Describe your process for identifying patterns PROBLEM SOLVING APPROACH ASSESSMENT: - Primary Focus: Assesses structured problem-solving methodology, creativity, root cause analysis, and implementation thinking. Evaluate their systematic and creative problem-solving abilities. - Probe with: How would you identify root causes? / What creative solutions complement traditional approaches? / How would you validate your solution assumptions? / Describe your problem-solving framework Integration Guidelines: 1. Embed assessment questions naturally into the case study scenarios 2. Design responses that reveal the selected competency areas 3. Create evaluation criteria for each assessment type 4. Provide guidance on what strong vs weak responses look like 5. Ensure questions measure depth beyond surface-level problem solving ===== CRITICAL NARRATIVE SEQUENCE ===== The case study MUST follow this exact structure: IMPORTANT: If a COMPANY BACKGROUND block is provided in the ORGANIZATION CONTEXT above, you MUST use the EXACT company name found there. The description MUST begin with the company name (for example: \"Acme Corp is a ...\"). Do NOT use the placeholder 'Company XYZ' when the actual company name is available in the context. If the company name cannot be determined from the provided content, do not invent one — instead start descriptions with 'The company' (avoid using 'Company XYZ' placeholder in that case). PART 1 - BACKGROUND (description field): 1. COMPANY OVERVIEW (1-2 sentences): - Start with: \"Company XYZ is a [industry] company that...\" - What they do, when founded, scale 2. COMPANY SCALE & PRESENCE (1-2 sentences): - Offices, employees, geographic reach - Growth trajectory 3. COMPANY EXPERTISE & CULTURE (1-2 sentences): - What they specialize in - How they work, values, mission 4. OPERATIONAL CONTEXT → CHALLENGE (remaining sentences): - Transition: \"However, Company XYZ recently faced...\" or \"Currently, Company XYZ is dealing with...\" - Describe the specific operational challenge/scenario - Include metrics and impact - Set up the problem for the role PART 2 - INSTRUCTIONS (instructions field): - Start with: \"As the Full Stack Developer at Company XYZ, you are tasked with...\" - Your role and responsibilities in THIS scenario - Specific objectives and success criteria - Constraints and resources - Stakeholder expectations - Timeline and deliverables ===== EXACT JSON RESPONSE STRUCTURE ===== { \"en\": { \"description\": \"COMPLETE BACKGROUND SECTION (600-900 words) following EXACT sequence: Company Overview → Scale → Expertise/Culture → Operational Challenge. This is ONE cohesive narrative, NOT separate sections. DO NOT include role assignment here. Focus entirely on company context and the situation that needs addressing. Make it specific to Full Stack Developer in tech industry.\", \"instructions\": \"ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION (300-400 words). Start with: 'As the Full Stack Developer at [Company Name], you are tasked with...' Then describe: your specific objectives, what success looks like, constraints/limitations, available resources, stakeholder expectations, and timeline. Reference the specific challenges mentioned in the background section above.\", \"questions\": [ \"Question 1 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 2 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 3 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 4 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 5 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 6 - specific to this scenario\", \"Question 7 - specific to this scenario\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Full Stack Developer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 1\", \"current_value\": \"45\", \"target_value\": \"60\", \"variance\": \"-25%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 2\", \"current_value\": \"8.2/10\", \"target_value\": \"9.0\", \"variance\": \"-8.9%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Example metric 3\", \"current_value\": \"$125K\", \"target_value\": \"$150K\", \"variance\": \"-16.7%\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the scenario\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"item\", \"label\": \"Item\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"status\", \"label\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"impact\", \"label\": \"Impact Level\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"Critical\", \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]}, {\"key\": \"notes\", \"label\": \"Details\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 1\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"impact\": \"High\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"}, {\"item\": \"Challenge/Resource 2\", \"status\": \"Pending\", \"impact\": \"Critical\", \"notes\": \"Description of impact\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"resources_constraints\", \"title\": \"Available Resources & Constraints\", \"description\": \"What you have to work with and limitations\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"resource_type\", \"label\": \"Resource Type\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"availability\", \"label\": \"Availability\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"cost_or_effort\", \"label\": \"Cost/Effort\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"constraint\", \"label\": \"Constraint\", \"type\": \"text\"} ], \"rows\": [ {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 1\", \"availability\": \"Fully available\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Included\", \"constraint\": \"Time-bound\"}, {\"resource_type\": \"Resource 2\", \"availability\": \"Limited\", \"cost_or_effort\": \"Additional budget needed\", \"constraint\": \"Capacity limited\"} ] } ] }, \"ar\": { \"description\": \"Arabic translation of BACKGROUND SECTION only\", \"instructions\": \"Arabic translation of ROLE & SCENARIO SECTION only\", \"questions\": [\"السؤا"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767262917349,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating concise, relevant case study titles. Based on this case study focus area and content, generate 2 titles: 1. An English title (max 80 characters, compelling and specific) 2. An Arabic title (max 80 characters, compelling and specific) CONTEXT: Job: Full Stack Developer Case Study Type: technical Psychometric Focus: cognitiveAbility, problemSolving Description Summary: The company is a tech company that specializes in designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications. It operates a dynamic development team based in Islamabad, Pakistan. Currently, the company is dealing with several operational challenges impacting their Full Stack Developer team.... Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"title_en\": \"English title here\", \"title_ar\": \"العنوان بالعربية هنا\" }"}
{"provider":"openai","timestamp":1767262918577,"prompt":"You are an expert at creating professional assessment questions for job candidates. IMPORTANT: If ADDITIONAL CONTEXT includes a CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES, reference those directly in question stems and scoring criteria (mention table titles, metrics or specific numbers where applicable). JOB CONTEXT: Job Title: Full Stack Developer Description: We are seeking a passionate Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic development team in Islamabad, Pakistan. This role is perfect for a mid-level professional with 3-5 years of experience who is eager to apply their technical skills to challenging projects and contribute to innovative solutions. As a Full Stack Developer, you will be responsible for designing and implementing both client-side and server-side applications. You will work closely with our team to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of our software solutions. Your role will be crucial in delivering high-quality applications that meet user needs and business goals. Key Responsibilities: • Develop and maintain web applications using modern frameworks and technologies • Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features • Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications • Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs • Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback • Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability • Implement security and data protection practices • Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends ADDITIONAL CONTEXT: CONTEXT USAGE INSTRUCTION: Use the CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION and TABLE SUMMARIES below as the primary source when generating module questions; reference specific metrics, table titles, and named entities when relevant. CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION: The company is a tech company that specializes in designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications. It operates a dynamic development team based in Islamabad, Pakistan. Currently, the company is dealing with several operational challenges impacting their Full Stack Developer team. These challenges involve maintaining high system availability and optimizing application performance while managing technical debt. The team aims to enhance deployment frequency and improve code quality by addressing bottlenecks in the development cycle. The company is focused on scaling their infrastructure to handle increased workloads, ensuring low latency and high throughput for their applications. As part of this initiative, they are looking to optimize CI/CD processes and improve incident response times, thereby reducing downtime and enhancing system reliability. The company operates in a fast-paced environment where collaboration among cross-functional teams is critical, and staying updated with emerging technologies is essential for success. This scenario sets the stage for the Full Stack Developer role to address these specific operational challenges. TABLE SUMMARIES: - Current Metrics & Performance: columns: Metric | Current Value | Target | Variance | Trend. sample_rows: {\"metric_name\":\"Deployment Frequency\",\"current_value\":\"3/week\",\"target_value\":\"5/week\",\"variance\":\"-40%\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"System Availability\",\"current_value\":\"99.2%\",\"target_value\":\"99.9%\",\"variance\":\"-0.7%\",\"trend\":\"↑ Improving\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Incident Response Time\",\"current_value\":\"45 mins\",\"target_value\":\"30 mins\",\"variance\":\"+50%\",\"trend\":\"→ Stable\"} - Situation/Context Data: columns: Item | Status | Impact Level | Details. sample_rows: {\"item\":\"Infrastructure Scaling\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"impact\":\"High\",\"notes\":\"Requires additional cloud resources\"} ; {\"item\":\"Technical Debt Reduction\",\"status\":\"Pending\",\"impact\":\"Critical\",\"notes\":\"Needs prioritization and resource allocation\"} - Available Resources & Constraints: columns: Resource Type | Availability | Cost/Effort | Constraint. sample_rows: {\"resource_type\":\"Cloud Computing Resources\",\"availability\":\"Fully available\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Included\",\"constraint\":\"Time-bound\"} ; {\"resource_type\":\"Development Team Capacity\",\"availability\":\"Limited\",\"cost_or_effort\":\"Additional budget needed\",\"constraint\":\"Capacity limited\"} FALLBACK CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"Company\": { \"Name\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Industry\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Founded\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"Scale\": { \"Employees\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Offices\": \"Islamabad, Pakistan\", \"Countries\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"Expertise\": { \"Specializations\": \"Designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"Software solutions\" }, \"Culture\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"CoreValues\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"Dynamic development team\" }, \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"ar\": { \"Company\": { \"Name\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Industry\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Founded\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"Scale\": { \"Employees\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Offices\": \"إسلام آباد، باكستان\", \"Countries\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"Expertise\": { \"Specializations\": \"تصميم وتنفيذ تطبيقات الجهة العميل والخادم\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"حلول البرمجيات\" }, \"Culture\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"غير مذكور\", \"CoreValues\": \"غير مذكور\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"فريق تطوير ديناميكي\" }, \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"غير مذكور\" } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === === PSYCHOMETRIC ASSESSMENT INTEGRATION === Include psychometric evaluation elements for: cognitiveAbility, problemSolving COGNITIVE ABILITY ASSESSMENT: - Primary Focus: Measures analytical thinking, logical reasoning, pattern recognition, and mental processing speed. Evaluate how the candidate breaks down complex information. - Probe with: How do you approach complex analytical problems? / Walk through your logical reasoning / How would you break down this ambiguous situation? / Describe your process for identifying patterns PROBLEM SOLVING APPROACH ASSESSMENT: - Primary Focus: Assesses structured problem-solving methodology, creativity, root cause analysis, and implementation thinking. Evaluate their systematic and creative problem-solving abilities. - Probe with: How would you identify root causes? / What creative solutions complement traditional approaches? / How would you validate your solution assumptions? / Describe your problem-solving framework Integration Guidelines: 1. Embed assessment questions naturally into the case study scenarios 2. Design responses that reveal the selected competency areas 3. Create evaluation criteria for each assessment type 4. Provide guidance on what strong vs weak responses look like 5. Ensure questions measure depth beyond surface-level problem solving PSYCHOMETRIC FOCUS (design questions to reveal these traits): - cognitiveAbility - problemSolving Design open-ended questions that allow assessment of cognitiveAbility, problemSolving based on the depth, structure, and reasoning in their responses. TASK: Generate 2 open-ended questions to assess candidates for this role. REQUIREMENTS: - Difficulty Level: MEDIUM - Questions should require detailed, thoughtful responses - Include scenario-based and reflective questions - Provide keywords/criteria for AI scoring - Include sample strong responses Return ONLY valid JSON with NO markdown, NO explanations: { \"questions\": [ { \"question_en\": \"English question text\", \"question_ar\": \"نص السؤال بالعربية\", \"expected_keywords\": [\"keyword1\", \"keyword2\", \"keyword3\"], \"scoring_criteria_en\": \"What to look for in a good answer\", \"scoring_criteria_ar\": \"ما يجب البحث عنه في الإجابة الجيدة\", \"sample_strong_response_en\": \"Example of a strong answer\", \"sample_strong_response_ar\": \"مثال على إجابة قوية\", \"min_word_count\": 100, \"max_word_count\": 500, \"difficulty\": \"medium\", \"category\": \"behavioral/analytical/creative\" } ] }"}
