 Detection: 73.2%] CUSTOM QUESTION SCORING INSTRUCTIONS: - Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly - For coding/SQL questions: Evaluate correctness, efficiency, best practices, edge cases - For open-ended/writing: Evaluate clarity, depth, relevance, structure - For video responses: Return score as null and feedback \"Pending manual review - recruiter must watch and score the video submission\". Video responses CANNOT be auto-scored. - For Excel tasks: Evaluate formula correctness, data analysis approach - For situational judgment: Evaluate decision-making, reasoning, practical application - Score each on 0-100 scale with detailed feedback (except video which should be null) CRITICAL: ALL TEXT FEEDBACK MUST BE IN Arabic. JOB/ASSESSMENT: Full Stack Developer CANDIDATE: Muhammad Muneeb CASE STUDY QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS: NOTE: Questions with higher weights are MORE IMPORTANT and should be evaluated more thoroughly. RETURN ONLY VALID JSON (no markdown, no explanations): { \"overall_score\": <0-100>, \"rating\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"ai_detected\": true, \"recruiter_feedback\": \"<Comprehensive feedback in Arabic>\", \"question_scores\": [], \"skill_scores\": [{ \"skill_name\": \"JavaScript\", \"category\": \"Programming\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in Arabic>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Collaboration\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in Arabic>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Communication\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in Arabic>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Problem Solving\", \"category\": \"Soft Skill\", \"score\": <0-10>, \"evidence\": \"<Specific evidence from answers in Arabic>\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Code Review\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": <0-1