task matching features and explored ML-based algorithms to recommend service providers. Secure Link | Flutter, OVPN Servers • Developed a secure VPN app for Android with a modern user interface and over 90 servers. • Utilized OVPN servers to ensure reliable and fast connections. • Designed and implemented the app using Flutter, emphasizing performance and user experience. LEADERSHIP / EXTRACURRICULAR Air University Cultural and Arts Society Fall 2021 – Present Operations Team Lead Air University, Islamabad • Directed operational activities for the cultural and arts society, ensuring seamless execution of various cultural events. • Developed and implemented strategic plans to optimize event workflows, resulting in a 20% increase in event efficiency. • Recognized for exceptional leadership in fostering a collaborative and high-performing environment within society. Zones IT Solutions Feb 2025 ServiceNow Developer Islamabad, Pakistan • Completed a 2-week intensive bootcamp focused on mastering ServiceNow and IT Service Management (ITSM). • Learned Incident & Problem Management, Change Management, Service Catalogs, Dashboards, and Reporting. • Gained hands on experience with REST APIs, integrations and scripting. Analyze the match and return ONLY this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text): { \"overall_match_score\": <0-100>, \"match_level\": \"<Poor|Fair|Good|Excellent>\", \"skills_match\": [ { \"skill_name\": \"<skill name>\", \"found_in_cv\": <true|false>, \"evidence\": \"<brief quote or evidence from CV>\", \"is_required\": <true|false> } ], \"experience_match\": <0-100>, \"experience_evidence\": \"<evidence of relevant experience>\", \"education_match\": <0-100>, \"education_evidence\": \"<education background>\", \"strengths\": [ \"<strength 1>\", \"<strength 2>\", \"<strength 3>\" ], \"gaps\": [ \"<gap 1>\", \"<gap 2>\" ], \"summary\": \"<2-3 sentence summary of the match>\", \"recommendation\": \"<Strong Hire|Interview|Review Manually|Reject>\" } SCORING RU